Ecosystem marker fixture A for CLM-045. It stands in for the manifest file one
ecosystem would leave in a project root -- a dependency declaration a detecting
implementation would key on.

Its sibling fixture B carries a DIFFERENT marker filename with different content. If
init's report, its written files, or its verdict ever differ between the two, init has
detected the ecosystem, which REQ-008 forbids outright.

The filename lives here in testdata, so it puts no literal in the init source set the
denylist claims scan.
